{
  "key": 54306,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "PokemonLeagueNorthPokecenter1F_Text_RivalIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Hold it!\n",
        "Don’t go off without me!\r",
        "You’re challenging the Pokémon League,\n",
        "aren’t you?\r",
        "That’s why I’m here, too.\r",
        "Let’s see who’s more worthy of making\n",
        "the challenge with a battle!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Arrête tout!\n",
        "Ne fais pas un pas de plus sans moi!\r",
        "Tu vas t’attaquer à la \n",
        "Ligue Pokémon, hein?\r",
        "Moi aussi, c’est pour ça que je suis là.\r",
        "Je te défie! Comme ça, on va savoir qui \n",
        "est digne d’affronter la Ligue Pokémon!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PokemonLeagueNorthPokecenter1F_Text_RivalDefeat",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: I guess I’m not ready\n",
        "for the Pokémon League if I’m losing\f",
        "to you!\r",
        "Darn it!\n",
        "You watch, though!\r",
        "I’ll get tougher and win my way\n",
        "through the Pokémon League!\r",
        "Because I’m going to become the\n",
        "Champion, the toughest Trainer!\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}! You’d better not lose to\n",
        "anyone before me!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Eh bien... J’imagine que \n",
        "je ne suis pas prêt pour la\f",
        "Ligue Pokémon si je perds contre toi!\r",
        "C’est trop nul!\n",
        "Mais attention!\r",
        "Je vais m’entraîner, et gravir les \n",
        "échelons jusqu’au sommet de la Ligue!\r",
        "Je vais être le Maître, le plus \n",
        "grand Dresseur de Sinnoh!\r",
        "Attention, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}! Ne t’avise pas\n",
        "de perdre contre quiconque avant moi!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PokemonLeagueNorthPokecenter1F_Text_ExamineGymBadges",
      "en_US": [
        "Let me confirm that you are qualified\n",
        "to challenge the Pokémon League.\r",
        "So! Let us examine the Gym Badges\n",
        "you gathered from Sinnoh.\r",
        "Oreburgh City’s Coal Badge!\r",
        "Eterna City’s Forest Badge!\r",
        "Hearthome City’s Relic Badge!\r",
        "Veilstone City’s Cobble Badge!\r",
        "Pastoria City’s Fen Badge!\r",
        "Canalave City’s Mine Badge!\r",
        "Snowpoint City’s Icicle Badge!\r",
        "And...\n",
        "Sunyshore City’s Beacon Badge!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Je dois d’abord vérifier ton aptitude à\n",
        "entrer dans la Ligue Pokémon.\r",
        "Laisse-moi voir tes Badges...\r",
        "Le Badge Charbon de Charbourg!\r",
        "Le Badge Forêt de Vestigion!\r",
        "Le Badge Fantôme d’Unionpolis!\r",
        "Le Badge Pavé de Voilaroc!\r",
        "Le Badge Palustre de Verchamps!\r",
        "Le Badge Mine de Joliberges!\r",
        "Le Badge Glaçon de Frimapic!\r",
        "Et enfin...\n",
        "Le Badge Phare de Rivamar!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PokemonLeagueNorthPokecenter1F_Text_CollectedAllGymBadges",
      "en_US": [
        "Very well!\r",
        "Trainer, you’ve indeed collected\n",
        "all the Gym Badges of Sinnoh!\r",
        "Demonstrate the power that brought\n",
        "you here and go for glory!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "C’est parfait!\r",
        "Dresseur, tu as réussi à rassembler les\n",
        "huit Badges d’Arène de Sinnoh!\r",
        "Prouve ta valeur, et sois à la hauteur \n",
        "de la gloire à laquelle tu aspires!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PokemonLeagueNorthPokecenter1F_Text_YouWillFaceTheEliteFour",
      "en_US": [
        "You will be facing the Elite Four\n",
        "of the Pokémon League.\r",
        "If you can’t beat all four of them\n",
        "in a row, you have to start from\f",
        "the first one again."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Tu t’apprêtes à affronter le Conseil 4\n",
        "de la Ligue Pokémon.\r",
        "Tu dois les battre tous les quatre\n",
        "à la suite, ou alors tu devras\f",
        "recommencer depuis le début."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PokemonLeagueNorthPokecenter1F_Text_ImNeverGivingUp",
      "en_US": [
        "It doesn’t matter if the going is slow.\r",
        "Nor does it matter how many challenges\n",
        "it takes.\r",
        "I’m never giving up!\n",
        "Not until I beat the Elite Four!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "La route sera longue et pavée de\n",
        "tentatives infructueuses. Peu importe!\r",
        "Je ne laisserai pas tomber tant que je\n",
        "n’aurai pas vaincu le Conseil 4!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PokemonLeagueNorthPokecenter1F_Text_ExperienceItForYourself",
      "en_US": [
        "What is the Pokémon League?\n",
        "Don’t take my word for it.\r",
        "Take the challenge and experience it\n",
        "for yourself!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Ce qu’est la Ligue Pokémon? Ne te fie\n",
        "pas à ce qu’en disent les gens.\r",
        "Relève le défi pour te faire ta propre\n",
        "opinion!"
      ]
    }
  ]
}